                                                "sense_id": "1f9bb6a7-acc8-3fc7-95c8-246d35a87678",
                                                "text": "...the hills of the robbers, predatorious oppreſſors of true Religion, pillagers and ſpoilers of the Church of Chriſt, of which too many ſad inſtances have been in ancient and later daies both at home and abroad."
