                                                "sense_id": "1f9bb6a7-acc8-3fc7-95c8-246d35a87678",
                                                "text": "Wall labels, if you read them, will prepare you for the shift from the conventional picture of the terrible Turk, the ravisher, the torturer, the pillager (see T. E. Lawrence) and the Turk of the massacres (see Delacroix and others)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09289025-cb14-4466-a10a-522b82e3f397",
                                                "sense_id": "1f9bb6a7-acc8-3fc7-95c8-246d35a87678",
                                                "text": "And then there were those who died and were martyred in the struggle to maintain a Jewish lifestyle, murdered at the hands of deathmongers, pillagers […]"
